From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Noa Himesaka <himesaka@noa.codes>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 22:36:58 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 03/10] clk: stub: add SM8350 RPMh clock controller

The UFS and USB PHYs take their reference clock from it.

Signed-off-by: Noa Himesaka <himesaka@noa.codes>
---
 drivers/clk/clk-stub.c | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/drivers/clk/clk-stub.c b/drivers/clk/clk-stub.c
index 4a6c7101..a679c5ec 100644
--- a/drivers/clk/clk-stub.c
+++ b/drivers/clk/clk-stub.c
@@ -59,6 +59,7 @@ static const struct udevice_id stub_clk_ids[] = {
 	{ .compatible = "qcom,sm6350-rpmh-clk" },
 	{ .compatible = "qcom,sm8150-rpmh-clk" },
 	{ .compatible = "qcom,sm8250-rpmh-clk" },
+	{ .compatible = "qcom,sm8350-rpmh-clk" },
 	{ .compatible = "qcom,sm8550-rpmh-clk" },
 	{ .compatible = "qcom,sm8650-rpmh-clk" },
 	{ }
